%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "24px", "fontFamily": "Arial", "primaryBorderColor": "#333333", "lineColor": "#333333"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "showSequenceNumbers": true, "mirrorActors": false, "diagramMarginX": 18, "diagramMarginY": 12, "actorMargin": 54, "messageMargin": 34, "boxMargin": 8, "boxTextMargin": 6, "noteMargin": 8}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant BE as BackendService
  participant DSP as DSP + calidad
  participant SON as Sonificación
  participant MUS as Motor musical
  participant MIDI as MIDI + firmware

  BE->>DSP: ventana CH1 lista
  DSP-->>BE: features + diagnostics + quality
  BE->>SON: adaptar features a controles
  SON-->>BE: SonificationFeatures 0..1

  alt calidad válida y periodo de compás
    BE->>MUS: segmento · compás · notas
    MUS-->>BE: lista NoteEvent
    BE->>MIDI: schedule + midi_bytes
    MIDI->>MIDI: note_on/off → Serial1 D1
  else ventana no fiable
    BE->>BE: no generar nuevo compás
  end

  opt Panic MIDI
    BE->>MIDI: All Sound Off + All Notes Off
  end
